; bal --exchange $ --unrealized books no unrealized gain on lots that the
; report leaves unvalued.  No commodity here has a market price.  market()
; values a lone lot at its lot price when it finds no market price, which
; is why Equity:Opening shows $-1500, but it does not do so for a balance,
; so the Brokerage and Coinbase accounts and the report total stay in
; their own commodities.  Whether the report can value what a posting
; contributes is therefore tested on that contribution taken as a balance.
; Tested as a lone amount, each lot here was valued at its lot price and
; booked at its cost, and the report printed an Equity:Unrealized Gains
; row equal to the negated report total, for the swap of regress/3227
; alone "-100 BTC / 200 ETH".  Under --dc each column is tested in the
; same way.

2024/01/01 Opening lots transferred in
    Assets:Brokerage       10 AAPL {$150}
    Equity:Opening        -10 AAPL {$150}

2024/02/01 Swap the lots for another asset
    Assets:Brokerage        5 XYZ {$300} @@ 10 AAPL {$150}
    Assets:Brokerage      -10 AAPL {$150}

2024/03/01 Coinbase
    Assets:Coinbase       100 BTC {$100} @ 2 ETH {$50}
    Assets:Coinbase      -200 ETH {$50}

test bal --exchange $ --unrealized --now 2024/04/01
             100 BTC
            -200 ETH
               5 XYZ  Assets
               5 XYZ    Brokerage
             100 BTC
            -200 ETH    Coinbase
              $-1500  Equity:Opening
--------------------
            -10 AAPL
             100 BTC
            -200 ETH
               5 XYZ
end test

test bal --exchange $ --unrealized --dc --now 2024/04/01
       10 AAPL
       100 BTC
         5 XYZ        10 AAPL
                    200 ETH        100 BTC
                                -200 ETH
                                   5 XYZ  Assets
       10 AAPL
         5 XYZ        10 AAPL          5 XYZ    Brokerage
       100 BTC        200 ETH        100 BTC
                                -200 ETH    Coinbase
             0        10 AAPL       -10 AAPL  Equity:Opening
-------------- -------------- --------------
       10 AAPL
       100 BTC
         5 XYZ        20 AAPL
                    200 ETH       -10 AAPL
                                 100 BTC
                                -200 ETH
                                   5 XYZ
end test
